# 意图路由

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[User message] --> R[risk_gate]
    R -->|high risk| S[safe_response + degraded]
    R -->|safe| I[intent_router]
    I -->|profile incomplete| C[clarification + degraded]
    I -->|create_plan| P[planning graph: initial]
    I -->|replan + continue| N[planning graph: continue]
    I -->|replan + adjust| J[planning graph: adjust]
    I -->|unsupported or query-only| U[clarification with resource-page guidance]
```

`hint_intent` 只允许 create_plan/replan，是前端提示。`replan_mode` 由服务端结合用户措辞、source plan 和 source review 推导为 continue/adjust；`start-next-plan` 创建的 mode 不能被客户端伪造。已有计划查询使用 `/plans`、`/tasks` 资源接口，不进入生成 Graph。最终路由写入 `resolved_intent/replan_mode`。
